# A kernel named hard_mix, which is what the module beside this file declares
# and what its mode does not ask for. Nothing here is an example worth copying:
# it is the shortest kernel that gives the refusal something to look for, and
# it is never dispatched, the mode that would name it having been refused.

kernel hard_mix

image dst

params:
    vec4 value


def hard_mix():
    if pixel.x >= image_size(dst).x or pixel.y >= image_size(dst).y:
        return
    image_store(dst, pixel, value)
